== H. the Syracuse clock  [t=3675.4s]
  Syrac(Z/9) = (0, 8, 16, 0, 11, 4, 0, 2, 22)/63  (Tao 2019, after Lemma 1.12) reproduced
  k = 1..8: class 0 null; class 1 has mass 1/3; G2 P(2x) = 2P(x) for x = 1 mod 3; G3 one-tick IFS identity;
            projection consistency (Tao (1.23))
  level 9: mu1(1) = mu1(4)/4 + 1/4, mu1(4) = mu1(7)/4 + 1/2, mu1(7) = mu1(1)/4  ->  (8, 11, 2)/21
  coupling: P(s | c=1) = P(s+1 | c=0) = (11, 2, 8)/21; the law is not a product of its marginals
  mod-9 residue chain: two distinct rows (out-twins over the sign bit), P^2 = 1 pi exactly
  step law (c,s) -> (v mod 2, 1+c+v mod 3) holds for all 10^6 odd A < 2*10^6
  mod 81: S(A) = (-1)^v (-2)^(lambda(A) - v), lambda(A) = log_(-2)(3A+1) = -A (mod 3): all odd A < 2*10^5
  A_(n+1) mod 9 = (-1)^(v_n) 4^(1 + v_(n-1) + v_n): all 2,200,000 orbit transitions
  empirical law of S^6(A) mod 9, 200000 random 80-bit A: TV distance 0.0048 to Tao

== I. triplet instances  [t=3697.9s]
  2040 primitive triples (m < 101): c +- (even leg) squares, c +- (odd leg) twice squares, never squares
  squaring on {1,4,7}: 1 fixed, 4 <-> 7; doubling on Z/3 = negation; p = 3 is the only prime with 2 = -1
  N <= 10^5: F = S + U  <=>  (U, S-U, F-S) palindromic; S = 2^U - 1 off squarefree;
             solutions exactly p, p^3, p^2qr; 60 = 2^2*3*5: split 3-4-3 and rank split 3-4-3 differ by p^2 <-> pqr
  primes 5 <= p < 200: p^3 = (p/3) (mod 9), p^2 in {1,4,7}

